$b['Dreaming Galaxy'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: Dreaming Galaxy - a woman''s profile with her eyes closed, the back of her head and her flowing hair dissolving into a spiral galaxy of violet, blue and gold nebula with a few small planets drifting out of it, her face staying clean and realistic while the galaxy pours out from her hairline. A Universe Within tattoo in cosmic colour realism. No text, labels, logos or watermarks in the tattoo. In the right panel it is on a woman, outer upper arm, a medium-to-large tattoo that still sits well inside that area, not a full sleeve.'
